Here this secret intro i what we need to break to get the flag for the ctf. So as i launched the instance it
started executing the lyrics of the song and when it stops on crowd we have to enter our input  here enter 
";RETURN 0" it resets the line pointer to line 0 where the secret intro and flag are stored, making the program
print the hidden text.

